Well, the second year said so.

8
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,720
OK, all right.

9
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,720
All right.

10
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,280
So today, we're going to finish week 14,

11
